SUMMARY:Odyssey Day
DESCRIPTION:“Sing to me of the Muse\, the man of twists and turns\,” and join fellow Odysseophiles to celebrate Odyssey Day on the Reynolds Green with the English Department as we explore Homer’s epic and its continuing importance in the 21st century. Enjoy food\, listen to readings from the poem\, or volunteer to read yourself. Come dressed as your favorite Odyssey character and enter the costume competition\, judged by Dean Tim Channell. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n     \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Accessibility\nUNC Asheville is committed to providing universal access to all of our events. If you have any questions about access or would like to request reasonable accommodations that will facilitate your full participation in the film screenings\, please contact Stephanie Bullick\, Director of Accessibility\, at accessibility@unca.edu.
URL:https://www.unca.edu/event/odyssey-day/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.unca.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Event-Calendar-9.png
END:VEVENT
